---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { builders } from '../../lib/artifact-builders';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
---
<Base title="Tools for your project · Gradient Ascent" description="Make project briefs, agent instructions, workflow specifications, acceptance criteria, audits, tool specifications, and handoffs for your own AI.">
<div class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow muted">From understanding to doing</div><h1>Tools for your project</h1><p>Turn what you know into a useful draft for your own AI. Start wherever you are; these are optional tools, not a required sequence. Each has examples, a few questions, and a Markdown export.</p></div>
<section class="panel"><h2>Not sure what you need yet?</h2><p>Start with a project brief. Describe the result you want and let your model help choose an approach. If you are still exploring, see a worked example first.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={url('/apply/')}>Create a project brief &rarr;</a><a href={url('/examples/')}>Explore worked examples</a></div></section>
<div class="tool-grid">{builders.map(b=><article class="panel"><h2><a href={url(`/tools/${b.slug}/`)}>{b.title}</a></h2><p>{b.description}</p><p class="output">Draft output: {b.filename}</p><a href={url(`/tools/${b.slug}/`)}>Open builder &rarr;</a></article>)}</div>
<section class="section"><h2>Give your model the whole context</h2><p>Copy or download a draft, attach representative inputs and outputs, and ask your agent to refine it. Unknown details remain questions; generated templates are not proof of a working system. Instructions describe boundaries, while permissions and execution controls enforce them.</p><div class="actions"><a href={url('/agents.md')}>Reference guide for models</a><a href={url('/tools.md')}>Model-readable tool directory</a><a href={url('/llms.txt')}>Full reference index</a></div></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Test the handoff before relying on it</h2><p>Have a fresh agent use your brief and a separate reviewer check its proposal. Learn how to preserve evidence, compare raw descriptions with builder exports, and run different providers in parallel.</p><a href={url('/examples/reviewer-feedback-loop/')}>Draft, hand off, review, improve &rarr;</a></section>
</Base>
<style>.tool-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:22px; margin:28px 0 } h2 {font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin-bottom:12px} article { display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px } article>a {margin-top:auto} a:not(.button) {color:var(--accent)} .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-top:20px}.output{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:700px){.tool-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
